# This is the PUBLIC CubePilot repository: documentation and releases only.
# No application source, build output, signing material or development assets
# belong here. The rules below are defence in depth — if git ever ignores a
# file because of this list, that file is in the wrong repository.
#
# Application source lives in the private repository. Compiled artifacts
# (.apk / .exe / .msix) are attached to GitHub Releases, never committed.

# --- Source ---
*.dart
*.kt
*.java
*.rs
*.swift
*.cpp
*.h
pubspec.yaml
pubspec.lock
analysis_options.yaml
Cargo.toml
Cargo.lock
lib/
test/
android/
ios/
windows/
linux/
macos/
web/

# --- Build systems and output ---
*.gradle
*.gradle.kts
gradlew
gradlew.bat
gradle/
build/
.dart_tool/
target/
out/

# --- Release artifacts (publish via GitHub Releases, do not commit) ---
*.apk
*.aab
*.exe
*.msix
*.msi
*.appx
*.zip
*.dmg

# --- Secrets and signing material ---
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pfx
*.pem
*.key
key.properties
*.env
.env*
google-services.json
secrets.*

# --- Editors and OS noise ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
